{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing At Stake is an open world action-adventure with a roguelike structure styled in the vein of classic n64 games, specifically taking inspiration from the first 3d Legend of Zelda games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/extras/eb5d5ba99c6e893f8027f352c027f801.avif?t=1772921953\" width=710 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within is an oblique dark fantasy world packed full of dungeons, ruins of a recently dead civilization, and colorful characters doing their best to survive in a seemingly hopeless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them make something of the scattered chaos that remains or set down your own path accumulating power as you scope out a land you'd been long isolated from. Whatever your path, tread carefully, as <strong>there is no coming back from death.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVER A DECADE AGO, THE DOMINANT CIVILIZATION FELL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/extras/d528a9a736a15e32044201bfad397979.avif?t=1772921953\" width=354 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRUCK BY AN OTHERWORLDLY FORCE, MANIFESTED IN THE FORM OF A 100 QUADRILLION TON CONGLOMERATION OF ROCK, METAL, AND OTHER INDETERMINATE SUBSTANCES.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/extras/70857fef7e6b426d6f846b95f377503d.avif?t=1772921953\" width=354 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A WORLD IN TATTERS, STREWN BY PILES OF RUIN AND UNDYING, UNMANAGED MACHINERY REMAINS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/extras/7a806bae3b826ace19abc390d5ed8882.avif?t=1772921953\" width=354 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FORMERLY SUBJUGATED PEOPLES SPREAD OUTWARD FROM THEIR FORMERLY PENNED-IN CORNERS, TRYING TO MAKE SENSE OF THE RUBBLE AND THEIR IMPENDING DOOM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/extras/ba9e61fe0381cb63519a0bc5ce1bce2c.avif?t=1772921953\" width=354 height=264 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3252750?t=1772921953","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3252750?t=1772921953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/7f5e5da4fdc9a86cc1171c925c86bf31ad2e5a05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772921953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/7f5e5da4fdc9a86cc1171c925c86bf31ad2e5a05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772921953","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains dark themes, psychological horror, fantasy violence, and some blood that may not be appropriate for younger audiences."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4393740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing At Stake is an open world action-adventure with a roguelike structure styled in the vein of classic n64 games, specifically taking inspiration from the first 3d Legend of Zelda games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252750/extras/eb5d5ba99c6e893f8027f352c027f801.avif?t=177